c("# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------", 
"# VITAL-HMB study spec", "#", "# Outcome: heavy menstrual bleeding (HMB) by alkaline hematin.", 
"#", "# This file is the single source of truth for every variable the report shows.", 
"# Adding a variable to the report means adding it here and nowhere else.", 
